Subject: [PATCH 04/12] SystemUI: add the YRRP fold animation style selector

Latches Stock, Pixel or Duo when the first gated unfold provider starts
and releases it when the last one finishes. It gates root unfold
progress (Stock drops it) and tells Shell which stretch to play.
